#. Description of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Accept cryptocurrency payments directly to your own wallets — no third-party"
" payment processor. Supports BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, "
"KAS, XTZ and 200+ coins/tokens with automatic on-chain verification."
msgstr ""
"تقبل دفعات التكفير مباشرة إلى محفظتك - لا مجهز للدفع من طرف ثالث. Supports "
"BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ and 200+ "
"coins/tokens with automatic on-chain verification."

#. Author of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "xorro"
msgstr "xorro"

